   <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Designed and deployed GenAI and multi-agent AI solutions for insurance and telecom industries.
Led a team of 7 Data Scientists, achieving measurable cost savings and efficiency improvements.
Delivered AI-driven QA automation, Contact Drivers, and objection-handling simulators.
Conducted technical interviews, hiring evaluations, and team upskilling sessions.
Championed the integration of advanced machine learning frameworks and cloud pipelines, bolstering deployment scalability and facilitating rapid model iteration cycles for core client projects.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
   <rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>true</rms:rms_experience_0_isCurrent>
